604
00:26:11,280 --> 00:26:18,400
Organized virtual coffee roulette, randomly pairing colleagues for informal 15-minute chats weekly, simulates those chance encounters.

605
00:26:18,580 --> 00:26:19,280
Coffee roulette.

606
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:19,800
Love it.

607
00:26:19,820 --> 00:26:20,360
