Celebrate work anniversaries virtually with digital cards or short videos.

611
00:26:32,940 --> 00:26:34,300
Intentional recognition.

612
00:26:34,540 --> 00:26:35,480
Intentionality again.

613
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:35,740
Okay.

614
00:26:36,020 --> 00:26:36,960
Switching to wellness.

615
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:40,670
The always-on culture is a real risk remotely.

616
00:26:41,190 --> 00:26:43,210
How does language help set boundaries?

617
00:26:43,380 --> 00:26:46,340
It starts with physical health prompts, since we're more sedentary.

618
00:26:46,500 --> 00:26:49,450
Schedule posture checks hourly reminders for micro stretches.

619
00:26:49,890 --> 00:26:51,510
And the classic eye strain advice.

620
00:26:51,970 --> 00:26:53,620
Practice 20-20-20 rule.

621
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:56,120
Look 20 feet away for 20 seconds every 20 minutes.

622
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:56,800
Good reminders.

623
00:26:57,350 --> 00:26:59,950
But the digital boundaries feel even more critical.

624
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:01,830
They are, the language needs to be firm.

625
00:27:02,130 --> 00:27:03,410
Log off at agreed hours.

626
00:27:03,750 --> 00:27:07,040
Sustained overwork kills productivity and leads to burnout, period.

627
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,340
