641
00:27:46,300 --> 00:27:49,210
Guard that focus time fiercely and encourage rest.

642
00:27:49,630 --> 00:27:55,300
Set quarterly recharge days, encouraging complete sign-offs and preventing vacation accrued yet unused.

643
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:57,920
FrameRest is a strategic need, not a luxury.

644
00:27:58,080 --> 00:27:59,360
Recharge days, nice.

